# Round 18, C2-32 (follows). As L4_4_known_inside_window, with v2 (known 2026-03-15, inside g's window) changing amt to
# 200.00 PLN: at the booking cut min(t, K) = t, v2 is visible for t from 2026-03-15 and not before (L §5.14.3), so the
# amount depends on the day: HOLE-IMPRECISE (q); windows each splits it, 100.00 PLN on 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-14 and
# 200.00 PLN on 2026-03-15 .. 2026-03-31 (q2, L §4.4).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind gifts: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input other: money PLN
input w: date

move g: gifts
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q: g.cash.amount
ask q2: g.cash.amount windows each

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  other = 1.00 PLN
  w = window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-31)
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-03-15
  replace amt = 200.00 PLN
=== expect
q: ?"date within window(2026-03-01, 2026-03-31) not precise enough for the booking cut of g" (g)
  cut 2026-06-30
q2 [w = 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-14]: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
q2 [w = 2026-03-15 .. 2026-03-31]: 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-06-30
warning: WARN-UNREAD input other is read by nothing
